{"name":"矮丛灌木","category":"tfc:farming_plus","icon":"tfcfarmingplus:food/lingonberry","pages":[{"type":"patchouli:text","text":"本模组新增 4 种矮丛浆果灌木，最高只有一格。$(br2)在合适土壤与气候下种植，生长按TFC配置计时；结果期右键采收，采后遵守开花冷却。锋利工具可回收主丛，蔓生幼株有概率；枝段掉木棍。南半球换季。自然株需在新生成区块寻找。"},{"type":"patchouli:empty"},{"type":"tfc:table","strings":[{"text":""},{"text":"Jan"},{"text":"Feb"},{"text":"Mar"},{"text":"Apr"},{"text":"May"},{"text":"Jun"},{"text":"Jul"},{"text":"Aug"},{"text":"Sep"},{"text":"Oct"},{"text":"Nov"},{"text":"Dec"},{"text":"越橘"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0xcca0db"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"text":"熊果"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0xcca0db"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"text":"岩高兰"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0xcca0db"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"text":"山蓝莓"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0xcca0db"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"}],"title":"矮丛灌木物候日历","text":"4 种矮丛灌木在一年中的状态变化。","legend":[{"text":"休眠","color":"0xa8986a"},{"text":"健康","color":"0x6ab553"},{"text":"开花","color":"0xcca0db"},{"text":"结果","color":"0xa217ff"}],"columns":12,"first_column_width":45,"column_width":15,"row_height":10,"left_buffer":8,"top_buffer":14,"draw_background":true},{"type":"patchouli:empty"},{"type":"patchouli:text","title":"越橘","anchor":"lingonberry","text":"可在下列区域找到：$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): -18°C - 16°C$(br)$(bold)地下水$(): 100 - 300mm$(br)$(bold)森林覆盖率$(): 2 - 4$(br2)栽培需$(bold)湿度$(): 25 - 75 %。$(br2)形态：$(thing)矮丛$() —— 低矮一丛，最高一格。$(br2)越橘在 4~6 月生长，7 月开花，8~9 月结果；多见于寒冷湿润的林缘与沼泽边。"},{"type":"tfc:multimultiblock","text":"一丛典型的越橘灌木。","multiblocks":[{"pattern":[["X"],["0"]],"mapping":{"X":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/lingonberry_bush[lifecycle=dormant,stage=2]"}},{"pattern":[["X"],["0"]],"mapping":{"X":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/lingonberry_bush[lifecycle=healthy,stage=2]"}},{"pattern":[["X"],["0"]],"mapping":{"X":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/lingonberry_bush[lifecycle=flowering,stage=2]"}},{"pattern":[["X"],["0"]],"mapping":{"X":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/lingonberry_bush[lifecycle=fruiting,stage=2]"}}]},{"type":"patchouli:text","title":"熊果","anchor":"bearberry","text":"可在下列区域找到：$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): -20°C - 14°C$(br)$(bold)地下水$(): 60 - 240mm$(br)$(bold)森林覆盖率$(): 2 - 4$(br2)栽培需$(bold)湿度$(): 15 - 60 %。$(br2)形态：$(thing)矮丛$() —— 低矮一丛，最高一格。$(br2)熊果在 5~6 月生长，7 月开花，8~9 月结果；极耐寒耐旱，生于开阔的砾石地与针叶林下。"},{"type":"tfc:multimultiblock","text":"一丛典型的熊果灌木。","multiblocks":[{"pattern":[["X"],["0"]],"mapping":{"X":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/bearberry_bush[lifecycle=dormant,stage=2]"}},{"pattern":[["X"],["0"]],"mapping":{"X":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/bearberry_bush[lifecycle=healthy,stage=2]"}},{"pattern":[["X"],["0"]],"mapping":{"X":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/bearberry_bush[lifecycle=flowering,stage=2]"}},{"pattern":[["X"],["0"]],"mapping":{"X":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/bearberry_bush[lifecycle=fruiting,stage=2]"}}]},{"type":"patchouli:text","title":"岩高兰","anchor":"crowberry","text":"可在下列区域找到：$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): -22°C - 14°C$(br)$(bold)地下水$(): 80 - 280mm$(br)$(bold)森林覆盖率$(): 2 - 4$(br2)栽培需$(bold)湿度$(): 20 - 70 %。$(br2)形态：$(thing)矮丛$() —— 低矮一丛，最高一格。$(br2)岩高兰在 5~6 月生长，7 月开花，8 月结果；生于岩石与苔原，耐极寒。"},{"type":"tfc:multimultiblock","text":"一丛典型的岩高兰灌木。","multiblocks":[{"pattern":[["X"],["0"]],"mapping":{"X":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/crowberry_bush[lifecycle=dormant,stage=2]"}},{"pattern":[["X"],["0"]],"mapping":{"X":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/crowberry_bush[lifecycle=healthy,stage=2]"}},{"pattern":[["X"],["0"]],"mapping":{"X":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/crowberry_bush[lifecycle=flowering,stage=2]"}},{"pattern":[["X"],["0"]],"mapping":{"X":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/crowberry_bush[lifecycle=fruiting,stage=2]"}}]},{"type":"patchouli:text","title":"山蓝莓","anchor":"bilberry","text":"可在下列区域找到：$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): -16°C - 18°C$(br)$(bold)地下水$(): 120 - 320mm$(br)$(bold)森林覆盖率$(): 2 - 4$(br2)栽培需$(bold)湿度$(): 30 - 80 %。$(br2)形态：$(thing)矮丛$() —— 低矮一丛，最高一格。$(br2)山蓝莓在 4~6 月生长，7 月开花，8 月结果；生于针叶林与酸性土壤。"},{"type":"tfc:multimultiblock","text":"一丛典型的山蓝莓灌木。","multiblocks":[{"pattern":[["X"],["0"]],"mapping":{"X":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/bilberry_bush[lifecycle=dormant,stage=2]"}},{"pattern":[["X"],["0"]],"mapping":{"X":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/bilberry_bush[lifecycle=healthy,stage=2]"}},{"pattern":[["X"],["0"]],"mapping":{"X":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/bilberry_bush[lifecycle=flowering,stage=2]"}},{"pattern":[["X"],["0"]],"mapping":{"X":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/bilberry_bush[lifecycle=fruiting,stage=2]"}}]}],"read_by_default":true,"sortnum":2,"extra_recipe_mappings":{"tfcfarmingplus:plant/lingonberry_bush":4,"tfcfarmingplus:food/lingonberry":4,"tfcfarmingplus:plant/bearberry_bush":6,"tfcfarmingplus:food/bearberry":6,"tfcfarmingplus:plant/crowberry_bush":8,"tfcfarmingplus:food/crowberry":8,"tfcfarmingplus:plant/bilberry_bush":10,"tfcfarmingplus:food/bilberry":10}}